### 如何引用此项目 / How to Cite:

如果你在研究或项目中使用了本代码，请按以下格式引用：

```bibtex
@software{pytorch_mnist_2026,
  author = {{Your Name}},
  title = {PyTorch MNIST Handwritten Digit Recognition},
  year = {2026},
  url = {https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Pytorch_MNIST},
  version = {1.0.0}
}
```

---

**注意**: 请将 `[Your Name]` 替换为你的真实姓名或用户名。  
**Note**: Please replace `[Your Name]` with your real name or username.
